WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:06.110
Let's knock them into next week, Kaido.

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.280
How many of those five
do you think will survive?

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.580
Trafalgar!

5
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.580
Can't you move one of them
downstairs with your ability?

6
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.800
If I could, I would've done it already.

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.130
Their haki's too strong. I can't move them!

8
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:31.340
In that case, let's disassemble 'em.

9
00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:38.100
Hey! Here comes a big one!

10
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.340
Hope your hips still work, you old hag!

11
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.800
Who do you think
you're talking to, smart aleck?!

12
00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.020
– Conquest of the Sea!
– Conquest of the Sea!

13
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.280
You've gotta be kidding me!

14
00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.950
No way! We can't dodge that!

15
00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:50.550
Get outta here, guys!

16
00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:02.890
If they keep this up...

17
00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.360
we're all done for!

18
00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.570
Zoro!

19
00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:32.630
I can't see them,
but I can still hear them...

20
00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:36.090
They must've escaped. Color me impressed.

21
00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.720
Zoro, are you alive?

22
00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.850
I think so...

23
00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:47.610
Nice work blocking it for as long as you did.

24
00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.320
Thanks.

25
00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:50.980
Where's Straw Hat?

26
00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.370
Kaido!

27
00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.710
Gum-Gum...

28
00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.630
Red...

29
00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.800
Why'd you dodge, Kaido?!

30
00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.100
Was it gonna hurt?!

31
00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.190
Ow, ow, ow...

32
00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.620
Extend your hand, no need to fear

33
00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.790
Cut through the wind, and persevere

34
00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:48.460
Chart your own course, the time to push forward is here

35
00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:56.760
In a time like a storm, hear the tidal waves roar,

36
00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.800
we keep trudging along but we're still wanting more

37
00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:03.310
But in spite of it all, the foundation we built

38
00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:05.930
for ourselves was about to fall

39
00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.810
Where the compass points - Is it right? Is it wrong?

40
00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.520
Who to ask? As if there's anyone listening

41
00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.860
I guess you'll never be one hundred percent sure

42
00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.320
But if you shut your eyes to the chaos,

43
00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:22.450
and you'd only take a breath

44
00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.750
When you open up your eyes

45
00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:29.460
you will find where you were meant to be

46
00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.880
Extend your hand, no need to fear

47
00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.090
Cut through the wind, and persevere

48
00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:40.970
Kick out the dark until the sky clears

49
00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:45.140
Even as we act in our own best interests,

50
00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:48.980
doing what we each believe is for our own

51
00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.770
Chart your own course, the time to push forward is here

52
00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:15.000
<b>Conqueror's Haki</b>

53
00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.590
Excellent! Burn!

54
00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:23.140
Let the flames rise!

55
00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.930
Dammit! They won't go down!

56
00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.680
We have enough problems as it is!

57
00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:34.940
Fukurokuju! You know where they keep
all those explosives, don't you?!

58
00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.320
Indeed. Allow me to show you the way.

59
00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:41.360
Everything is ablaze! What is going on?!

60
00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:45.830
Go to hell, Kaido!

61
00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:48.580
And take your
New Onigashima Project with you!

62
00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.950
Orochi!

63
00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.290
This was all your doing?!

64
00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.670
Ah, so you finally show your faces!

65
00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.040
The half-ghost vermin of the Kozuki!

66
00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.380
What are you even here for?!

67
00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:04.140
For twenty years,
you've gone to hell and back,

68
00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:06.600
and now you've followed me all the way here!

69
00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:10.430
Is that how much you hate me?
How much you resent me?!

70
00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.060
Lord Orochi...

71
00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:15.270
They are not aware that you've died once.

72
00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.730
Please make your escape.

73
00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.110
I shall dispose of–

74
00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.230
Butt out, you simpleton!

75
00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.860
You're covered in cuts and bruises...

76
00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.620
No wonder!

77
00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:28.740
You ran willingly to your own deaths!

78
00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:32.580
You guys must be completely
out of your minds!

79
00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.830
Orochi! We have no time
to waste on a fool like you.

80
00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:36.960
Move!

81
00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.710
And if I refuse?

82
00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.340
What?!

83
00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:58.110
Do you have any idea
just who it is you're defying?!

84
00:06:58.110 --> 00:07:00.520
Know your place, rodents!

85
00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.740
I am the shogun of Wano!

86
00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.820
What's with that look?!

87
00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:10.370
I've done nothing wrong!

88
00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:15.410
All I did was take revenge on
the Kozuki as they rightly deserved!

89
00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.500
I only took back
what was stolen from me!

90
00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:29.390
But you oafs just don't get it!

91
00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:33.930
Citizens and samurai alike are meant to
bow before and obey their shogun!

92
00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.190
I'm the one with the power here!

93
00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:39.860
Flower Shuriken!

94
00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:46.530
It's all because this country oppressed me!

95
00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.290
Th-That look in your eyes!

96
00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.500
Are you trying to tell me that I'm wrong?!

97
00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.880
Don't look at me...

98
00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.170
Don't look at me!

99
00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.340
I can't be wrong!

100
00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:15.270
Stop looking at me like that!

101
00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.360
Lord Orochi!

102
00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.570
Your punishment will be decided in hell.

103
00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.370
Onward!

104
00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.910
Will you avenge your lord?

105
00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.670
I thought too little of you, Fukurokuju.

106
00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:43.590
Foolish as he was, you remained
loyal until the bitter end.

107
00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:46.550
I could say the same to all of you!

108
00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:51.090
Even had I not sought vengeance,
you and I would be destined to fight!

109
00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.180
I'm sure you understand, Raizo!

110
00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.180
Indeed!

111
00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.220
Let's do this!

112
00:08:57.810 --> 00:08:59.980
You asked for it, whelp!

113
00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.170
Not gonna happen!

114
00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.340
Come all at once for all I care!

115
00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.140
Give it to him good!

116
00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.520
You shithead!

117
00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:45.690
Thanks!

118
00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.120
Kaido!

119
00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:12.970
Conqueror of Three Worlds...

120
00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.640
Ragnaraka!

121
00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:27.060
Luffy!

122
00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.070
Let's mop up the leftovers, too!

123
00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.160
It's ready!

124
00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:35.870
Okay!

125
00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.070
Room!

126
00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:38.530
Shambles!

127
00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.830
Where am I?! It's so dark!

128
00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.370
Zeus!

129
00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.380
You got this, Roronoa?!

130
00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:49.500
I'd better!

131
00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.300
You're not getting back to her!

132
00:10:56.970 --> 00:11:00.220
Flame-Rend: Crossing the Six Paths!

133
00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:06.150
Quit it! Come on, I'm just a sword!

134
00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.980
– Mama, help!
– Mama, help!

135
00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.070
You guys!

136
00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:10.860
Now!

137
00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.610
Punk Pistols!

138
00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.530
What now?!

139
00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:21.490
You actually thought tearing us apart
would be enough to beat us?!

140
00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:30.920
Repel!

141
00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:34.550
Takt!

142
00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:39.350
You nitwit!

143
00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.720
You think a rock is enough to finish me?!

144
00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.390
Die!

145
00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:50.860
Crap!

146
00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.240
Mama!

147
00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:01.410
If she can't get help, then that's one down!

148
00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:05.500
How do you like that?!

149
00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.170
Come help me!

150
00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.170
Zeus!

151
00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.220
Mama!

152
00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.640
What's going on, Mama?!

153
00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.810
Mama! I'm coming to–

154
00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.610
Mama! I'm gonna–

155
00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.450
That moron...

156
00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:54.920
I wouldn't be surprised if he shattered
every bone in his body back there!

157
00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:59.260
That was pathetic, Linlin!

158
00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:03.140
I have to do everything myself.

159
00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:07.810
Hey, Pirate Hunter!

160
00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.190
Release Prometheus!

161
00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.150
Shambles!

162
00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:21.530
Injection Shot!

163
00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:28.700
You've got one hell of a strange ability!

164
00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.870
Trafalgar!

165
00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.290
Curtain!

166
00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.430
Mama!

167
00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.010
Stay away!

168
00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:49.810
Mama!

169
00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.230
Hey, Traffy!

170
00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.280
Fire-face there...

171
00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:02.150
is gonna save Big Mom!

172
00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.120
Just let him go...

173
00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.330
I'd rather the mission be a failure...

174
00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.130
than have one of us die.

175
00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:26.100
All we wanted to do was
separate Big Mom and Kaido!

176
00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:31.020
No need to put your life on the line!

177
00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.190
Leave Big Mom to me!

178
00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.830
That was close!

179
00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.540
I'm glad you're safe, Mama!

180
00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.210
Aren't you just the sweetest?

181
00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.420
Prometheus!

182
00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.300
Unlike somebody...

183
00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.720
What the hell is Zeus doing?!

184
00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:09.100
Useless little airhead!

185
00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:13.100
I...

186
00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.810
couldn't agree more, Mama!

187
00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.480
He's such a klutz, always lagging behind.

188
00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.230
You said it!

189
00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:27.200
Hey, so, I got a favor to ask, Mama!

190
00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:29.120
What is it?

191
00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:53.060
Look at Straw Hat's face!

192
00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:57.390
It's just like last time.

193
00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:01.360
He's out cold, and yet...

194
00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:04.940
he's still glaring at me!

195
00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:09.870
Should those eyes...

196
00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:13.080
be the first things I crush?

197
00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.290
Or maybe...

198
00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.870
his brain?

199
00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.630
Or even his heart?!

200
00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.590
Traffy.

201
00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.340
What I'm about to do...

202
00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.890
will push me to the limit.

203
00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.600
Zoro?!

204
00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.310
Dragging things out here...

205
00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:36.770
is only wearing us down.

206
00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.150
And if this doesn't work...

207
00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:43.070
then it's just our time to die.

208
00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.820
After this...

209
00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:47.860
it's all you.

210
00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.330
Hey, Kaido!

211
00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:09.130
That's our captain!

212
00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.890
Why don't you try...

213
00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.680
crushing my head first?!

214
00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.980
Demonic Nine-Sword Style!

215
00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.150
Asura!

216
00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.910
Blades Drawn!

217
00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:55.970
Nine-Sword Style!

218
00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.830
<b>ASURA</b>
<b>BLADES</b>
<b>DRAWN</b>

219
00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:17.830
Asura: Blades Drawn...

220
00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.040
<b>DEAD MAN'S</b>
<b>GAME</b>

221
00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:21.040
Dead Man's Game!

222
00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.150
Damn!

223
00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.910
This kid...

224
00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.660
Don't tell me...

225
00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.830
you've got conqueror's haki, too?!

226
00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.790
What are you talking about?

227
00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.420
I don't know what you mean.

228
00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:17.800
That was... my ultimate attack!

229
00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:25.600
Would've been nice...
if you'd at least fallen down...

230
00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:29.110
You've done plenty.

231
00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:31.690
This scar will remain.

232
00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.500
This generation, I tell you...

233
00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:52.170
Hey! Zoro, run!

234
00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.840
Don't trouble yourself.

235
00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:02.220
I'll just come to you.

236
00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:06.020
Thunder Bagua!

237
00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.460
What a shame...

238
00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:36.380
If you'd just come with me,
we could've achieved world domination...

239
00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.760
With you?

240
00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:41.470
We'd never join up with you, idiot.

241
00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:48.480
We love samurai.

242
00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:55.780
I'm gonna kick your ass, end of story!

243
00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.280
You're...

244
00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.370
gonna kick my ass, huh?

245
00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:12.960
Give it your best shot.

246
00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.590
As if your reckless fists...

247
00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.510
would ever be good enough!

248
00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.640
Don't strain yourself!

249
00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:34.690
It's a powerful force that is both
an invisible armor and a tool for offense.

250
00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.190
However, if you advance to the next level,

251
00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:41.860
the haki that covers you
will become even stronger,

252
00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:46.030
reaching inside your opponents
and destroying them from within.

253
00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:50.410
Don't strain yourself!

254
00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:54.380
Allow the unused haki in
your body to flow to your fist!

255
00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.260
Kong Gun!

256
00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:07.890
It was still too shallow.

257
00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:12.810
Power blooms in our darkest hour!

258
00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:18.570
But after taking that hit
from your club, I figured it out.

259
00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:24.700
You can infuse things with
conqueror's haki, can't you?

260
00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:33.250
How will knowing that help you?

261
00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.130
Think you can do it?!

262
00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:49.350
Only the strongest...

263
00:22:49.350 --> 00:22:52.930
can wield it like that!

264
00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:54.730
You half-ghost rat!

265
00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.460
Don't strain yourself!

266
00:23:56.460 --> 00:24:00.380
Allow the unused haki in
your body to flow to your fist!

267
00:24:57.810 --> 00:24:59.310
He didn't even touch him!

268
00:25:31.930 --> 00:25:33.220
Zoro...

269
00:25:35.560 --> 00:25:37.060
Traffy...

270
00:25:38.060 --> 00:25:41.520
Thanks for watching my back.

271
00:25:42.940 --> 00:25:45.110
Now head downstairs!

272
00:25:45.570 --> 00:25:49.070
